<div id="abstract1" class="ltx_abstract"><h6 class="ltx_title ltx_title_abstract">Abstract</h6>
    
<p id="abstract1.1" class="ltx_p">In the appendix, we present more details of this work.
In Section <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A URBAN-SIM Visualization ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we illustrate samples of scenes for Urban Locomotion, Navigation, and Traverse tasks.
In Section <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B URBAN-SIM Design Details ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we introduce the design details of <span id="abstract1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-SIM</span> platform.
In Section <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C URBAN-SIM Performance Benchmark ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>, we construct extensive performance benchmarks of <span id="abstract1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-SIM</span>.
In Section <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Human-AI Shared Autonomous Approach ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>, we give details and discuss the properties of the human-AI shared autonomous approach.
In Section <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E URBAN-BENCH Experimental Details ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a>, we elaborate on implementation details in the experiments of <span id="abstract1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-BENCH</span> and evaluate the necessity of foundational tasks.
In Section <a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Datasheet ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a>, we provide the datasheet of <span id="abstract1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-SIM</span>.
In Section <a href="#A7" title="Appendix G Discussion ‣ Towards Autonomous Micromobility through Scalable Urban Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">G</span></a>, we discuss the impacts, sim-to-real generalization, limitations, and future directions of this work.</p>
  
</div>
