<span id="A6.T8.6.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.1pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">This work was created and funded by the <span id="A6.T8.6.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-X</span> team.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T8.6.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T8.6.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:0.0pt;height:14.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"></span><span id="A6.T8.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Composition</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T8.6.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T8.6.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-bottom: 10.84006pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:173.9pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">What do the instances that comprise the dataset represent?</span>
