<span id="A6.T8.6.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.1pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Each instance is a JSON file, including the configuration of the scenes in <span id="A6.T8.6.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-SIM</span> and a specific seed.</span>
</span></td></tr>
