</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.6.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 10.84006pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.1pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">There are 1,536 scenes released in the dataset derived from <span id="A6.T8.6.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">URBAN-SIM</span>, along with the code to sample substantially more.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T8.6.7" class="ltx_tr">
