</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.6.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 10.84006pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.11.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.1pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.11.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Each urban scene is created independently, so there are no connections between the scenes.</span>
</span></td></tr>
