<span id="A6.T8.6.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Is the dataset self-contained, or does it link to or otherwise rely on external resources (e.g., websites, tweets, other datasets)?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.6.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 10.84006pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.14.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:298.1pt;">
<span id="A6.T8.6.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The dataset is self-contained.</span>
</span></td></tr>
